# React + Vite

- Functional components only. Default-export page/section components; named-export hooks and utils.
- Keep state local (`useState` / context). Do not add a global store for UI chrome.
- In-page navigation uses `react-scroll` to section `id`s, not `react-router-dom`.
- Put static identity assets in `public/` (photos, CV, favicon). Put project screenshots in `src/assets/` and import them from `src/data/projects.js`.
- After changing UI, layout, routing, or rendered content, verify in the browser — appearance plus interaction.

```jsx
// ❌ BAD — copy locked inside the component
<p>Soy desarrollador Front-End...</p>

// ✅ GOOD
<p>{t(profile.summary)}</p>
```
